\u003e— — — — — — — — —\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Điểm nổi bật \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Dễ dàng lắp ráp: Chỉ cần dùng tua vít siết ốc liên kết các tấm gỗ lại với nhau. Con gái cũng có thể dễ dàng lắp ráp. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Đẹp: Các cạnh trước sau trên dưới đều được xử lý đẹp.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Sử dụng lâu dài: Chất liệu MDF bề mặt phủ melamine loại tốt (căng, phẳng, dày và đồng màu).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Đầy đủ phụ kiện và hướng dẫn lắp đặt kèm theo sản phẩm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/f2/cf/62/48ea7cdfa3ab2c928eb6891d7d73ed42.jpg\" alt=\"f2cf62c4c31a66bcfb1ff2850e146851.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/a0/da/2f/65ea8b783571b715133416539a3f8c10.jpg\" alt=\"a0da2f2bc8c29ace911f8f0f504cc605.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/e0/79/f6/4fa03785a9da2a924566b726f2fb0866.jpg\" alt=\"e079f6f9a7b861f2058c6a4a19cf5d25.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/1c/e9/2c/5de6e607e9202b0570a1af43eb1d629d.jpg\" alt=\"1ce92c9825b543eb1e5176dd33cb80ae.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/f3/41/66/b8df8cbd7cf1348a84706404e0746158.jpg\" alt=\"f3416663d272dfea13c973474335f6cd.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/98/b0/9a/f24d84e72b800b8a6ea40e6640291229.jpg\" alt=\"98b09a75ec2d868aa76cd6ae4d409bbf.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"530\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/11/ef/c9/8de1e3475d50eb90711ca501e4911a